---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import SystemStatus from '../components/SystemStatus.astro';
---

<Layout title="Face Exchange">
  <main class="exchange-space" data-app data-view="corridor" data-entrance="outside">
    <SystemStatus />

    <section class="corridor-hub" data-corridor aria-labelledby="corridor-title">
      <div class="corridor-shell" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="corridor-plane corridor-plane--left"></div>
        <div class="corridor-plane corridor-plane--right"></div>
        <div class="corridor-plane corridor-plane--ceiling"></div>
        <div class="corridor-plane corridor-plane--floor"></div>
        <div class="vanishing-lines"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="hub-heading corridor-plaque">
        <h1 id="corridor-title">FACE EXCHANGE</h1>
        <p>FACE EXCHANGE</p>
        <span>Identity Asset Market</span>
      </div>

      <div class="three-corridor" data-three-corridor aria-label="Interactive 3D Face Exchange corridor" tabindex="0"></div>

      <div class="fallback-corridor" data-fallback-corridor aria-label="Simplified Face Exchange corridor" hidden>
        <div class="fallback-door-track">
          <button class="corridor-door" type="button" data-fallback-door data-station="0" data-door="enterRoom" style="--station-index: 0;">
            <span>01</span><strong>INTRO</strong><small>start exchange</small>
          </button>
          <button class="corridor-door" type="button" data-fallback-door data-station="1" data-door="submitRoom" style="--station-index: 1;">
            <span>02</span><strong>SUBMIT</strong><small>face material</small>
          </button>
          <button class="corridor-door" type="button" data-fallback-door data-station="2" data-door="classifyRoom" style="--station-index: 2;">
            <span>03</span><strong>CLASSIFY</strong><small>identity package</small>
          </button>
          <button class="corridor-door" type="button" data-fallback-door data-station="3" data-door="valueRoom" style="--station-index: 3;">
            <span>04</span><strong>VALUE</strong><small>fictional scores</small>
          </button>
          <button class="corridor-door" type="button" data-fallback-door data-station="4" data-door="auctionRoom" style="--station-index: 4;">
            <span>05</span><strong>AUCTION</strong><small>agent bids</small>
          </button>
          <button class="corridor-door" type="button" data-fallback-door data-station="5" data-door="costRoom" style="--station-index: 5;">
            <span>06</span><strong>COST</strong><small>hidden market</small>
          </button>
          <button class="corridor-door" type="button" data-fallback-door data-station="6" data-door="reflectRoom" style="--station-index: 6;">
            <span>07</span><strong>REFLECT</strong><small>exit question</small>
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="corridor-hints" aria-label="Corridor movement hints">
        <p class="station-readout" id="station-readout" aria-live="polite">01 INTRO</p>
        <p data-entrance-instruction>SCROLL / W TO APPROACH</p>
        <p data-gate-instruction>CLICK GATE TO ENTER</p>
        <p data-corridor-instruction>SCROLL / W / S TO MOVE</p>
        <p data-node-instruction>CLICK NEARBY FACE NODE TO ENTER</p>
        <button class="entrance-action" type="button" data-enter-entrance>ENTER FACE EXCHANGE</button>
        <details class="accessible-nav">
          <summary>Keyboard navigation</summary>
          <div class="accessible-nav__controls">
            <button class="secondary-action" type="button" data-prev-door>PREVIOUS NODE</button>
            <button class="primary-action" type="button" data-enter-active>ENTER NEARBY NODE</button>
            <button class="secondary-action" type="button" data-next-door>NEXT NODE</button>
          </div>
        </details>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="room-layer" aria-live="polite">
      <section class="room-scene room-scene--enter" data-room="enterRoom" aria-labelledby="enter-title" tabindex="-1">
        <div class="room-frame">
          <p class="terminal-label">ROOM 01 / INTRO</p>
          <h2 id="enter-title">FACE EXCHANGE</h2>
          <p class="stage-copy">Welcome to Face Exchange.</p>
          <p class="stage-copy">A fictional market where faces become digital products.</p>
          <p class="stage-copy">Choose a face. Classify it. Value it. Auction it.</p>
          <p class="stage-copy">This is not real face recognition. This is not a real scoring system. It is a speculative joke about how identity becomes value.</p>
          <p class="stage-copy stage-copy--question">Who creates the value of a face, and who owns it?</p>
          <div class="blueprint-box blueprint-box--threshold">
            <span>SHOP FOR A FACE</span>
            <span>TURN IDENTITY INTO PRODUCT</span>
            <span>WATCH VALUE GET INVENTED</span>
          </div>
          <div class="room-actions">
            <button class="secondary-action" type="button" data-return-corridor>RETURN TO CORRIDOR</button>
            <button class="primary-action" type="button" data-continue="submitRoom">ENTER THE MARKET</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="room-scene room-scene--submit" data-room="submitRoom" aria-labelledby="submit-title" tabindex="-1">
        <div class="room-frame room-frame--wide">
          <p class="terminal-label">ROOM 02 / SUBMIT FACE</p>
          <h2 id="submit-title">SUBMIT YOUR FACE</h2>
          <p class="stage-copy">Your face is now market material.</p>
          <p class="stage-copy">Upload a face or use the camera to create a market entry.</p>
          <div class="capture-grid">
            <div class="camera-panel">
              <video id="camera-video" class="camera-video" playsinline muted hidden></video>
              <canvas id="capture-canvas" hidden></canvas>
              <div class="preview-frame" id="empty-preview"><span>LOCAL FACE PREVIEW WAITING</span></div>
              <img id="face-preview" class="face-preview" alt="Submitted face preview" hidden />
            </div>
            <div class="control-stack">
              <div class="privacy-panel">
                <p>Your image stays in this browser.</p>
                <p>It is not uploaded.</p>
                <p>No face recognition is used.</p>
                <p>No AI analysis is used.</p>
              </div>
              <button class="secondary-action" type="button" id="start-camera">USE CAMERA</button>
              <button class="secondary-action" type="button" id="take-photo" hidden>TAKE STILL IMAGE</button>
              <label class="upload-label" for="image-upload">UPLOAD IMAGE</label>
              <input id="image-upload" type="file" accept="image/*" />
              <p class="microcopy" id="camera-message" aria-live="polite">Camera access is optional. Upload remains available if access is unavailable or denied.</p>
              <p class="microcopy microcopy--market">Congratulations. Your face is ready to become a product.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="room-actions">
            <button class="secondary-action" type="button" data-return-corridor>RETURN TO CORRIDOR</button>
            <button class="primary-action" type="button" data-continue="classifyRoom" id="capture-next" disabled>CONTINUE TO NEXT ROOM</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="room-scene room-scene--classify" data-room="classifyRoom" aria-labelledby="classify-title" tabindex="-1">
        <div class="room-frame room-frame--wide">
          <p class="terminal-label">ROOM 03 / CLASSIFY FACE</p>
          <h2 id="classify-title">CHOOSE A FACE PRODUCT CATEGORY</h2>
          <p class="stage-copy">The market does not see a person first. It sees categories, labels and possible uses.</p>
          <div class="package-layout">
            <div class="scan-card">
              <img id="package-preview" class="face-preview" alt="Submitted face with simulated scan overlay" hidden />
              <div class="scan-overlay" aria-hidden="true"></div>
              <div class="metadata-tags" id="metadata-tags"></div>
            </div>
            <fieldset class="mode-fieldset">
              <legend>Choose one fictional asset category</legend>
              <label class="mode-card"><input type="radio" name="package-mode" value="corporate" /> <span>Job Interview Face</span><small>For employability, professionalism and corporate trust.</small></label>
              <label class="mode-card"><input type="radio" name="package-mode" value="verified" /> <span>Passport Face</span><small>For access, verification and official identity.</small></label>
              <label class="mode-card"><input type="radio" name="package-mode" value="influencer" /> <span>Influencer Face</span><small>For attention, visibility and platform circulation.</small></label>
              <label class="mode-card"><input type="radio" name="package-mode" value="creative" /> <span>Trustworthy Service Face</span><small>For care, customer support and public trust.</small></label>
              <label class="mode-card"><input type="radio" name="package-mode" value="premium" /> <span>Luxury Identity Face</span><small>For status, aspiration and premium branding.</small></label>
              <label class="mode-card"><input type="radio" name="package-mode" value="livestream" /> <span>Algorithm-Friendly Face</span><small>For visibility, trend and machine-readable appeal.</small></label>
            </fieldset>
          </div>
          <ol class="status-lines" aria-live="polite">
            <li>FACE RECEIVED</li>
            <li>PRODUCT CATEGORY OPENED</li>
            <li>MARKET USE CASE ATTACHED</li>
            <li>FACE VALUE READY FOR PRICING</li>
          </ol>
          <div class="room-actions">
            <button class="secondary-action" type="button" data-return-corridor>RETURN TO CORRIDOR</button>
            <button class="primary-action" type="button" data-continue="valueRoom" id="package-next" disabled>CONTINUE TO NEXT ROOM</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="room-scene room-scene--value" data-room="valueRoom" aria-labelledby="value-title" tabindex="-1">
        <div class="room-frame room-frame--wide">
          <p class="terminal-label">ROOM 04 / VALUE FACE</p>
          <h2 id="value-title">FACE VALUE DASHBOARD</h2>
          <p class="stage-copy">These numbers are fictional. They show how an interface can make subjective judgement look measurable.</p>
          <p class="system-line value-comment" id="value-comment">FACE VALUE IS BEING PRODUCED</p>
          <div class="value-grid" id="value-grid"></div>
          <div class="room-actions">
            <button class="secondary-action" type="button" data-return-corridor>RETURN TO CORRIDOR</button>
            <button class="primary-action" type="button" data-continue="auctionRoom">CONTINUE TO NEXT ROOM</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="room-scene room-scene--auction" data-room="auctionRoom" aria-labelledby="auction-title" tabindex="-1">
        <div class="room-frame room-frame--wide">
          <p class="terminal-label">ROOM 05 / AGENT BIDDING CHAMBER</p>
          <h2 id="auction-title">FACE AUCTION ROOM</h2>
          <p class="stage-copy">Different agents bid because they want different things from the face.</p>
          <p class="stage-copy">The face does not have one fixed value. Its value changes depending on who wants to use it.</p>
          <section class="face-market-gallery" aria-labelledby="gallery-title">
            <p class="terminal-label" id="gallery-title">SHOPPING FOR A FACE</p>
            <div class="face-product-grid">
              <article class="face-product-card"><div class="product-face" aria-hidden="true"></div><span>118 FVU</span><strong>Job Interview Face</strong><p>Professional trust and employability packaging.</p><button class="secondary-action" type="button">VIEW BID</button></article>
              <article class="face-product-card"><div class="product-face" aria-hidden="true"></div><span>142 FVU</span><strong>Passport Face</strong><p>Access, verification and official identity proof.</p><button class="secondary-action" type="button">ADD TO IDENTITY</button></article>
              <article class="face-product-card"><div class="product-face" aria-hidden="true"></div><span>207 FVU</span><strong>Influencer Face</strong><p>Visibility, attention and platform circulation.</p><button class="secondary-action" type="button">VIEW BID</button></article>
              <article class="face-product-card"><div class="product-face" aria-hidden="true"></div><span>133 FVU</span><strong>Trustworthy Service Face</strong><p>Care, customer support and public confidence.</p><button class="secondary-action" type="button">ADD TO IDENTITY</button></article>
              <article class="face-product-card"><div class="product-face" aria-hidden="true"></div><span>260 FVU</span><strong>Luxury Identity Face</strong><p>Status, aspiration and premium branding.</p><button class="secondary-action" type="button">VIEW BID</button></article>
              <article class="face-product-card"><div class="product-face" aria-hidden="true"></div><span>184 FVU</span><strong>Algorithm-Friendly Face</strong><p>Trend, visibility and machine-readable appeal.</p><button class="secondary-action" type="button">ADD TO IDENTITY</button></article>
            </div>
          </section>
          <div class="auction-grid" id="auction-grid">
            <article class="auction-card" data-agent="employer"><span>FVU AGENT A</span><strong>Employer Agent</strong><p>Bids for employability, authority and professional trust.</p><small>This face could perform well in a job market.</small><output id="bid-employer">0</output></article>
            <article class="auction-card" data-agent="platform"><span>FVU AGENT B</span><strong>Platform Agent</strong><p>Bids for attention, visibility and engagement.</p><small>This face could circulate well.</small><output id="bid-platform">0</output></article>
            <article class="auction-card" data-agent="advertiser"><span>FVU AGENT C</span><strong>Advertiser Agent</strong><p>Bids for trust, lifestyle signal and selling power.</p><small>This face could sell aspiration.</small><output id="bid-advertiser">0</output></article>
            <article class="auction-card" data-agent="verification"><span>FVU AGENT D</span><strong>Verification Agent</strong><p>Bids for access, compliance and identity control.</p><small>This face could become proof.</small><output id="bid-verification">0</output></article>
            <article class="auction-card" data-agent="collector"><span>FVU AGENT E</span><strong>Collector Agent</strong><p>Bids for rarity, resale potential and identity asset value.</p><small>This face could become collectible.</small><output id="bid-collector">0</output></article>
          </div>
          <p class="system-line" id="auction-message">BIDS WAITING FOR VALUE INPUT</p>
          <p class="stage-copy stage-copy--note">The auction is fictional. The logic is familiar. Different systems compete to define the value of a face.</p>
          <div class="room-actions">
            <button class="secondary-action" type="button" data-return-corridor>RETURN TO CORRIDOR</button>
            <button class="primary-action" type="button" data-continue="costRoom">CONTINUE TO NEXT ROOM</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="room-scene room-scene--cost" data-room="costRoom" aria-labelledby="cost-title" tabindex="-1">
        <div class="room-frame room-frame--wide">
          <p class="terminal-label">ROOM 06 / HIDDEN MARKET COST ROOM</p>
          <h2 id="cost-title">HIDDEN COSTS</h2>
          <p class="stage-copy">When a face becomes market value, something is lost.</p>
          <fieldset class="cost-fieldset">
            <legend>Select hidden costs registered by the system</legend>
            <label><input type="checkbox" value="Ownership becomes unclear" /> Ownership becomes unclear</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox" value="The face becomes reusable asset material" /> The face becomes reusable asset material</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox" value="The person loses control" /> The person loses control</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox" value="Platform visibility decides value" /> Platform visibility decides value</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox" value="Personal identity becomes a market category" /> Personal identity becomes a market category</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox" value="Judgement becomes price" /> Judgement becomes price</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox" value="The face can be separated from the person" /> The face can be separated from the person</label>
          </fieldset>
          <p class="system-line" id="cost-message" aria-live="polite">AWAITING HIDDEN COST SELECTION</p>
          <div class="room-actions">
            <button class="secondary-action" type="button" data-return-corridor>RETURN TO CORRIDOR</button>
            <button class="primary-action" type="button" data-continue="reflectRoom">CONTINUE TO NEXT ROOM</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="room-scene room-scene--reflect" data-room="reflectRoom" aria-labelledby="reflection-title" tabindex="-1">
        <div class="room-frame room-frame--wide">
          <p class="terminal-label">ROOM 07 / REFLECTION EXIT ROOM</p>
          <h2 id="reflection-title">WHO OWNS THE MARKET VALUE OF A FACE?</h2>
          <div class="result-grid">
            <div class="scan-card result-preview-card">
              <img id="result-preview" class="face-preview" alt="Submitted face in exchange result" hidden />
              <div class="scan-overlay" aria-hidden="true"></div>
              <p class="system-line">SYSTEM STATUS: EXCHANGED</p>
            </div>
            <div class="result-panel" id="result-panel"></div>
          </div>
          <fieldset class="reflection-fieldset">
            <legend>Choose one answer</legend>
            <label><input type="radio" name="reflection" value="the person" /> the person</label>
            <label><input type="radio" name="reflection" value="the platform" /> the platform</label>
            <label><input type="radio" name="reflection" value="the employer" /> the employer</label>
            <label><input type="radio" name="reflection" value="the advertiser" /> the advertiser</label>
            <label><input type="radio" name="reflection" value="the collector" /> the collector</label>
            <label><input type="radio" name="reflection" value="the algorithm" /> the algorithm</label>
          </fieldset>
          <div class="reflection-response" id="reflection-response" aria-live="polite" hidden>
            <p>A face does not have one fixed value. Its value is produced by the systems that want to use it.</p>
            <p>If a face can become a product, people should have more control, consent and ownership over the value created from their identity.</p>
            <p class="final-message">END OF EXCHANGE PATH</p>
          </div>
          <details class="testing-questions">
            <summary>User testing questions</summary>
            <ol>
              <li>What do you think this project is joking about?</li>
              <li>Did it feel like shopping for a face?</li>
              <li>Which part felt funny?</li>
              <li>Which part felt uncomfortable?</li>
              <li>Which agent felt most believable?</li>
              <li>Who do you think owns the value of a face?</li>
              <li>What part was confusing?</li>
            </ol>
          </details>
          <div class="room-actions">
            <button class="secondary-action" type="button" data-return-corridor>RETURN TO CORRIDOR</button>
            <button class="secondary-action" type="button" id="start-again">START AGAIN</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
  <script>
    import '../scripts/faceExchange.js';
  </script>
</Layout>
